+/**
+ * cc_background_chooser_select_file:
+ *
+ * Plinius: the one way to add backgrounds (the button of the page's header bar): pictures, and
+ * videos and GIFs with plinius-ambient 0.5, several at once; file_dialog_open_cb sorts them.
+ */
